Package: strawwu-target-setup
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: strawwu-initd, python3
Maintainer: StrawCoding <apt@wastebase.xyz>
Description: StrawWU Calamares target chroot setup hook
 Runs post-install configuration inside the Calamares chroot:
 initializes setup state, installs staged StrawWU debs, and
 records lifecycle.target_setup. Supports --repair-only for rescue.
